  "releaseNotes": "# 🚀 Release Notes – SqlInjectionGuardToolKit\n\n---\n\n# ✅ Version 1.0.0 – Initial Stable Release 🎉🔥\n\n📅 Release Date: 2026\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Overview\n\nThis is the first stable release of **SqlInjectionGuardToolKit**, a lightweight SQL Injection detection and sanitization library for .NET.\n\nThe toolkit is designed to provide automatic validation and safe input handling with minimal developer effort.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ ✨ Key Features\n\n✔ SQL Injection Pattern Detection Engine  \n✔ Automatic String Sanitization  \n✔ Attribute-Based Validation  \n✔ SafeSqlString Type  \n✔ DTO-Level Protection  \n✔ MVC Filter Integration  \n✔ Middleware Support  \n✔ Console Validation Support  \n✔ CLI Tooling Support  \n\n---\n\n## ✅ 🛡 Security Capabilities\n\n✔ Detection of common SQL keywords  \n✔ Logical operator pattern detection  \n✔ Inline comment injection detection  \n✔ Batch separator detection  \n✔ Stored procedure abuse indicators  \n\nExample detected patterns:",
